{"unit_id":"CAT0998__dsh-ai-cursor#feature-1","repo":"CAT0998/dsh-ai-cursor","commit":"2bd2fd94d2bb36e281f07759beba9f1d6de6aab6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-cursor 的功能「独立光标移动」：agent 可按屏幕绝对坐标移动专属光标，并选择滑动时长；操作不会移动真实鼠标。通过 ai_mouse_move 工具触发，参数为 x、y 和可选 duration_ms。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:644-669"]}
