{"unit_id":"CAT0998__dsh-ai-cursor#feature-3","repo":"CAT0998/dsh-ai-cursor","commit":"2bd2fd94d2bb36e281f07759beba9f1d6de6aab6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ai-cursor 的功能「外观与权限控制」：浮动面板及工具可设置光标主题、徽标文字和权限等级；权限级别决定 agent 能否显示、移动或修改外观。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:673-708","src/permissions.ts:21-49"]}
